Short:        pi coding agent (amiga-pi) for UP-Term
Author:       spotUP
Uploader:     UPLOADER-ADDRESS-PLACEHOLDER (spotUP)
Type:         comm/misc
Version:      @VERSION@
Replaces:     none
Architecture: m68k-amigaos >= 3.0.0; m68k-020
Requires:     comm/term/UP-Term.lha >= @NEEDSBASE@, TCP/IP stack (Roadshow, Miami, AmiTCP), util/libs/AmiSSL-v5-OS3.lha for https
Distribution: Aminet

C:amiga-pi: pi (pi.dev, version 1.1.0), the coding agent, for an UP-Term window. It reads,
searches and edits files and runs commands with the model of your choice (Anthropic, OpenAI
and compatible servers, Google, Azure, Bedrock) and your own key. Lua extensions, prompt
templates, skills and MCP servers work as in pi.

Needs the base archive UP-Term.lha (version @NEEDSBASE@ or newer) installed first.

Install: unpack, double-click Install. It makes ENVARC:amiga-pi if it is missing and never
overwrites settings.json, models.json or auth.json. Uninstall removes C:amiga-pi and keeps
ENVARC:amiga-pi.

